- `typecheck` ✓, `lint` ✓, `build` ✓; headless playwright run confirmed light→dark token swap (`--bg #fdfcfa→#0f0e11`, `--text #18171a→#f0ede7`, `--accent #2563eb→#4f8aff`), Geist font resolves on body, no console errors. Screenshots at `/tmp/us-002-light.png`, `/tmp/us-002-dark.png`.
